      "cachePath": ".cache\\gameaichecker-review\\20261104T184414-5bbd58\\4950600\\thread-0.html",
      "locator": "forum_op + all visible replies",
      "quote": "A shame this was considered to begin with. Pay translators fairly.\nTopcat View Profile View Posts 1 1 Oct 30 @ 7:22pm Report this post I agree that this sucks and proper translators would have been better but this is a fairly small indie game so I feel like we should cut the developer some slack as they may not have had the budget to hire good translators #1\nKorkBurningapple View Profile View Posts Nov 1 @ 1:25am Report this post The developer of this title is a solo developer. As anyone who has played this game will know, it all comes down to the choice of words. I think it’s enough simply to write: ‘This game was brilliant! However, I think the translation would sound more natural if it were done by a human! Thank you for making this game! I’ll continue to support you!’ Just by changing the way you phrase things slightly, how much more like a person of integrity and common sense would you appear? I believe that very attitude is what matters most. #2",
